      "body": "",
      "button_link": "",
      "button_text": "",
      "description": "OEM manufacturing is suited to clients who already have a product design, drawing, specification, or reference and need a manufacturing partner to produce it according to approved requirements.\n\nODM manufacturing is suited to clients who need support developing or adapting a product. NESS can work from an existing product, reference image, sketch, concept, or initial specification and support the process from technical development and material selection to sampling and production.\n\nBoth models can be adapted to different project requirements, production quantities, materials, finishes, and packaging specifications.",
